---
// Faint graph-paper texture on the ink background. Purely decorative, non-interactive.
---

<div class="grid-backdrop pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 -z-10 bg-ink" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
  .grid-backdrop {
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(to right, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-border) 60%, transparent) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-border) 60%, transparent) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 32px 32px;
    opacity: 0.35;
  }
</style>
